  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wildlife Without Borders-Western Hemisphere</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this grant, PCI Media will develop the capacity of local NGOs to use communication tools to effectively to promote water and biosphere conservation. In addition, the Recipient will build a well-informed and engaged community of organizations that support biodiversity conservation and watershed management, and will work to change the level of knowledge and attitudes of key target audiences to implement practices that reduce deforestation and environmental degradation, address climate change, restore natural systems and maintain ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
